			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Update all element submodules to latest development states\n\nSynchronize the Land editor architecture by updating all 14 element submodules (Air, Cocoon, Common, Echo, Grove, Maintain, Mist, Mountain, Output, Rest, SideCar, Sky, Wind, Worker) to their respective latest commits.\n\nKey updates include:\n- **Mountain & Cocoon**: Implement dual-layer DebugServer (ports 9933/9934) for independent Rust and Node.js introspection, plus full SCM diff command handling (`$scm:openDiff`, `vscode.diff`).\n- **Output**: Introduce `InjectWebviewBlobUrlRewrite` to resolve WKWebView cross-protocol security failures, converting `vscode-*` schemes to stable blob URLs for extension panels.\n- **Sky & Wind**: Complete the round-trip IPC contract for the diff operation, ensuring SCM UI requests correctly resolve promises and render diffs without hanging.\n- **Documentation**: Initialize Rust documentation roots (README.md) across Air, Common, Echo, Mist, Rest, and SideCar submodules to establish architectural reference points.\n- **Maintenance**: Standardize whitespace in ESBuild configs, regenerate command/service catalogs for upstream VS Code sync, and update dev dependencies (@types/node, wrangler, miniflare).\n\nThese changes restore full debuggability across the stack, fix critical webview rendering issues, and establish the foundational documentation structure for the codebase.",
			"SHA": "b671621cdc5d58efcf81e67e05e5b7715c83e772"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-18T00:32:17Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⡟⠀⠀",
				26,
				14
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Rebrand all components and dependencies to FIDDEE identity\n\nExecute a comprehensive rebranding of the CodeEditorLand project to the new internal codename \"FIDDEE\" across all submodules. This change updates application identifiers, bundle names, telemetry keys, data directory paths, and URI schemes to align with the new product identity.\n\nKey modifications include:\n- **Mountain**: Update `Info.plist`, `tauri.conf.json`, and URI schemes to use `fiddee` identifiers.\n- **Wind & Sky**: Replace \"Land\" with \"FIDDEE\" in configuration constants, manifest files, and PostHog telemetry bridges.\n- **Cocoon**: Standardize environment identifiers and telemetry event properties to `fiddee`.\n- **Common**: Align telemetry app identifiers and correct markdown rendering artifacts.\n- **Output**: Implement product identity replacement to strip VS Code's \"Code - OSS\" branding in favor of \"FIDDEE\".\n- **Rest & SideCar**: Fix path separator logic and JSON serialization formatting artifacts.\n- **Air, Echo, Mist, Grove, Vine, Worker**: Update configuration roots, documentation headers, and telemetry identifiers.\n\nSimultaneously address whitespace inconsistencies (tab characters, HTML entities, LaTeX escapes) in documentation headers and codegen outputs to ensure consistent rendering and serialization across the Rust and TypeScript toolchains.\n\nThis ensures the entire stack, from native backend to UI and build pipelines, consistently identifies as FIDDEE.",
			"SHA": "a40e7dad6beceae9deaec3ca7b7d664296001848"
		},
